The production X156 GLA is closely based on the Concept GLA design and was unveiled at the [[Frankfurt Motor Show#2013|2013 Frankfurt Motor Show]].<ref>[http://media.daimler.com/dcmedia/0-921-658901-1-1631055-1-0-0-0-0-1-0-1549054-0-1-0-0-0-0-0.html?TS=1408408477987 Five Mercedes-Benz world premieres at the 2013 IAA: Benchmark for automotive passion]</ref><ref>[http://www.autoblog.com/2013/09/11/2015-mercedes-gla-class-frankfurt-2013/ 2015 Mercedes-Benz GLA-Class hits the matte]</ref> Orders had been taken beginning from the end of November 2013, and arrived in dealer showrooms during 2014, with Japan and US in the autumn.<ref>[http://www.autoblog.com/2013/08/14/2015-mercedes-gla-class-official-frankfurt-debut/ 2015 Mercedes GLA-Class officially bound for Frankfurt]</ref>

At launch, Mercedes-Benz claimed the vehicle was the most aerodynamic in its segment, with a Cd figure of 0.29.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Fit for off-road excursions: Multi-talented: The new Mercedes-Benz GLA|url=https://media.daimler.com/marsMediaSite/en/instance/ko/Fit-for-off-road-excursions-Multi-talented-The-new-Mercedes-Benz-GLA.xhtml?oid=9903591|access-date=2021-03-23|website=marsMediaSite|language=en}}</ref> The GLA's platform makes use of a strut-type front suspension and a [[Multi-link suspension|multi-link]] rear setup, and an electric power steering.<ref>{{Cite web|last=Meiners|first=Jens|date=2013-08-14|title=2015 Mercedes-Benz GLA-class|url=https://www.caranddriver.com/news/a15114725/2015-mercedes-benz-gla-class-photos-and-info-news|access-date=2021-03-23|website=Car and Driver|language=en-US}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=2015 Mercedes-Benz GLA preview|url=https://www.motorauthority.com/news/1086224_2015-mercedes-benz-gla-preview|access-date=2021-03-23|website=Motor Authority|date=14 August 2013 |language=en}}</ref>

Nissan marketed a restyled variant of the GLA from 2016 to 2019 through its Infiniti brand in North America as the [[Infiniti Q30]] and [[Infiniti QX30|QX30]], sharing the GLA mechanicals with revised exterior sheet metal.<ref>{{cite web|last=Derek|first=James|title=Mercedes-Benz GLA-Class vs. Infiniti QX30: Buy This, Not That|url=https://www.motorbiscuit.com/mercedes-benz-gla-class-infiniti-qx30-buy-this-not-that/|access-date=7 February 2018|work=Motor Biscuit|date=5 September 2016}}</ref> The Infiniti derivatives were produced between 2016 and 2019.<gallery widths="200" heights="130">
