===Marketing===
As part of a partnership between Mercedes-Benz and [[Nintendo]], the two companies released a television commercial featuring [[Mario]] driving a Mercedes-Benz GLA in the Japanese market in May 2014 to coincide with the line's Japanese launch. Additional commercials featuring other ''[[Mario (franchise)|Mario]]'' characters in the same style were released in November 2014, culminating in the GLA becoming a selectable vehicle in ''[[Mario Kart 8]]'' and its [[Mario Kart 8 Deluxe|Switch port]] with Mercedes' [[Mercedes-Benz W25|W 25 Silver Arrow]] and [[Mercedes-Benz 300 SL|300 SL Roadster]] also being included.<ref>[http://www.autoblog.com/2014/05/29/super-mario-bros-mercedes-gla-video/ Mario Bros. enlisted to sell Mercedes GLA in Japan with bizarre results]</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=http://www.polygon.com/2014/11/12/7204107/mercedes-bizarre-mario-kart-ads-roll-on-with-luigi-and-peach|title=Mercedes' bizarre Mario Kart ads roll on with Luigi and Peach|website=[[Polygon (website)|Polygon]] |date=12 November 2014}}</ref>

